Status reporting (FR-026, FR-027, SC-005) and the look of a rolled-back device, 2026-10-30.
Board with slot B (fb19ed4) running, slot A retired by the scenario-B test, then a genuine bundle (6d5dbc6)
installed into A with the helper try_bundle, and a reboot. Console capture by the user; host clock in brackets.
EXCERPT: the status commands; the install's repeated lines and the kernel boot messages are omitted.

